# Cursor subagent model policy

- Every Cursor subagent must use `model: cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh`.
- This selector means Grok 4.6 with `effort=xhigh`; do not append bracket
  syntax or use a separate unsupported effort selector.
- Do not use `inherit`, `auto`, a lower-effort model, or silent fallback.
- If this exact selector is unavailable, stop and report the dispatch as
  blocked.

This rule constrains Cursor subagent model selection only. It does not define
any workflow or role process.
